OL,3,GNEWSAAirport plan could see an extra 10
OL,4,Aflights a night
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds Bradford Airport could run an
OL,7,Fextra 10 flights a night during the
OL,8,Fsummer if changes to their operating
OL,9,Frules are approved, the chief executive
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FCurrently the airport is permitted
OL,13,F2,920 aircraft movements between 23:00
OL,14,Fand 07:00 BST during the summer, but
OL,15,Fbosses want to switch to a model that
OL,16,Fmonitors overall noise levels instead
OL,17,Fof counting take-offs and landings.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
