OL,3,GNEWSAAirport plan could see an extra 10
OL,4,Aflights a night
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is also applying to condense
OL,7,Fnight-time hours to between 23:30 and
OL,8,F05:59, with the plans set to be decided
OL,9,Fon by Leeds City Council later this
OL,10,Fautumn.
OL,12,FLBA say the changes would help the
OL,13,Fairport grow and keep airlines at the
OL,14,Fsite, but campaigners say an increase
OL,15,Fin night flights would impact their
OL,16,Fability to sleep.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
